    P3_KPI --> DB_KPIS
    P3_DASH --> P3_REV
    P3_REV --> DB_REV

    P3_DASH --> P4_DASH
    P4_DASH --> P4_CALC
    P4_CALC --> P4_SHARE
    P4_CALC --> P4_ESOP
    P4_CALC --> P4_VEST
    P4_CALC --> DB_CAP
    P4_CALC --> DB_VEST
    P4_CALC --> DB_HIST

    P4_DASH --> P5_DASH
