    P9_CLOSE -->|advancePhase 9 to 10| P10_DASH
    P10_DASH --> P10_STATUS

    %% Post deal effects
    DB_DEALS -->|Recompute AmountRaised| DB_COMPANY
    DB_DEALS -->|Issue Shares to Investor| DB_CAP
